  m_Name: Mermaid
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CreatureData
  creatureName: 'Mermymph '
  description: 'A species of social fish that lives in schools of around seven Mermyphs.
    They hunt by stunning or attracting prey using various sounds: from whistles
    to screams and songs that sound almost identical to human voices. Their vocal
    range is dangerously wide and their screams can be very loud.

'
  note: "It almost looks like a kid, but one time I saw a deer drinking some water
    next to a group of Mermyphs and\u2026 I don\u2019t really want to describe what
    happened to the deer, but at least it was quick."
